<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-070-B habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.376893" lon="-120.87925"><name>SC26-070-B</name><desc>Morro Bay rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 8.3 m relief across 210 m. Terrain B 68/100; not catch probability. Center 56 ft; nearby 48–75 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9HEZNRO"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-050</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.379271657628664" lon="-120.8786927948767"/><trkpt lat="35.37882112370213" lon="-120.87870459246948"/><trkpt lat="35.37874260954491" lon="-120.87936707856673"/><trkpt lat="35.378472289051565" lon="-120.87937415476661"/><trkpt lat="35.37776302294463" lon="-120.88005314309753"/><trkpt lat="35.37776688501301" lon="-120.88027318282299"/><trkpt lat="35.376240859586275" lon="-120.88064331491202"/><trkpt lat="35.37587270901232" lon="-120.88021267400303"/><trkpt lat="35.37586498461207" lon="-120.8797726048956"/><trkpt lat="35.37630392927662" lon="-120.87910070751545"/><trkpt lat="35.376296200745294" lon="-120.87866063638398"/><trkpt lat="35.376025880266155" lon="-120.87866771430082"/><trkpt lat="35.37592611064887" lon="-120.87811998734946"/><trkpt lat="35.376459019225315" lon="-120.8776657560888"/><trkpt lat="35.376533656762355" lon="-120.87678325170481"/><trkpt lat="35.37715473195919" lon="-120.87621662754951"/><trkpt lat="35.37714892771248" lon="-120.87588657133826"/><trkpt lat="35.37777967422073"